{"step_index":41,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:33:19Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:33:19+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:33:19+08:00\nShowing lines 1-84 of 84\n1: # -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\r\n2: \"\"\"\r\n3: V5 场景可编辑化：把程序生成的环境整理成\"能手工编辑\"的工程\r\n4:   1) 原点归位：所有 ZV5_ 环境对象的 origin 从 (0,0,0) 挪到各自几何中心\r\n5:      （否则你在 Blender 里选中赛道按 G 拖，是绕一千米外的原点转，看起来\"动不了\"）\r\n6:   2) 集合分组：Road / Terrain / Barriers / Stands / Pit / Props / Lighting\r\n7:   3) 保留 world 变换不变，渲染结果不受影响（纯工程整理）\r\n8: \r\n9: 用法: blender -b -P pipeline/v5_organize.py\r\n10: \"\"\"\r\n11: import bpy\r\n12: import os\r\n13: from mathutils import Vector\r\n14: \r\n15: PROJ = r\"D:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\"\r\n16: BLEND = os.path.join(PROJ, \"LATEST\", \"v5_stage_anim.blend\")\r\n17: \r\n18: bpy.ops.wm.open_mainfile(filepath=BLEND)\r\n19: \r\n20: GROUPS = {\r\n21:     \"V5_01_Road\": (\"V5_Track\", \"V5_RacingLine\", \"V5_Line_\", \"V5_Kerb_\",\r\n22:                    \"V5_StartLine\", \"V5_PitLane\", \"V5_PitLine\", \"V5_PitBoxLine\"),\r\n23:     \"V5_02_Terrain\": (\"V5_Ground\", \"V5_Verge_\", \"V5_Gravel_\", \"V5_HedgeRing\", \"V5_SkyDome\"),\r\n24:     \"V5_03_Barriers\": (\"V5_Barrier\", \"V5_FencePosts\"),\r\n25:     \"V5_04_Stands\": (\"V5_Stand_\", \"V5_Flag_\"),\r\n26:     \"V5_05_Pit\": (\"V5_PitWall\", \"V5_PitGarage\", \"V5_PitRoof\", \"V5_PitTop\"),\r\n27:     \"V5_06_Props\": (\"V5_Ad_\", \"V5_Brake_\", \"V5_Screen_\", \"V5_Bridge_\",\r\n28:                     \"V5_Marshal_\", \"V5_FieldMasts\", \"V5_Hangar_\",\r\n29:                     \"V5_Gantry\", \"V5_StartLight\"),\r\n30:     \"V5_07_Lighting\": (\"LGT_V5\",),\r\n31: }\r\n32: \r\n33: # ---------- 1. 原点归位 ----------\r\n34: moved = 0\r\n35: for ob in list(bpy.data.objects):\r\n36:     if ob.type != 'MESH':\r\n37:         continue\r\n38:     if not (ob.name.startswith(\"V5_\") or ob.name.startswith(\"GEO_Race\")):\r\n39:         continue\r\n40:     if len(ob.data.vertices) == 0:\r\n41:         continue\r\n42:     bb = [ob.matrix_world @ Vector(c) for c in ob.bound_box]\r\n43:     c = Vector((sum(v.x for v in bb) / 8.0, sum(v.y for v in bb) / 8.0, sum(v.z for v in bb) / 8.0))\r\n44:     inv = ob.matrix_world.inverted()\r\n45:     local_c = inv @ c\r\n46:     for v in ob.data.vertices:\r\n47:         v.co -= local_c\r\n48:     ob.location = c\r\n49:     ob.data.update()\r\n50:     moved += 1\r\n51: print(\"origin_to_geometry:\", moved, \"objects\")\r\n52: \r\n53: # ---------- 2. 集合分组 ----------\r\n54: def bucket(name):\r\n55:     for g, prefixes in GROUPS.items():\r\n56:         for p in prefixes:\r\n57:             if name.startswith(p):\r\n58:                 return g\r\n59:     return None\r\n60: \r\n61: root = bpy.context.scene.collection\r\n62: cols = {}\r\n63: for g in GROUPS:\r\n64:     c = bpy.data.collections.get(g) or bpy.data.collections.new(g)\r\n65:     if c.name not in root.children:\r\n66:         root.children.link(c)\r\n67:     cols[g] = c\r\n68: \r\n69: regrouped = 0\r\n70: for ob in list(bpy.data.objects):\r\n71:     g = bucket(ob.name)\r\n72:     if not g:\r\n73:         continue\r\n74:     # 从所有集合移除（保留在场景里）\r\n75:     for c in list(ob.users_collection):\r\n76:         c.objects.unlink(ob)\r\n77:     cols[g].objects.link(ob)\r\n78:     regrouped += 1\r\n79: print(\"regrouped:\", regrouped, \"objects\")\r\n80: \r\n81: print(\"collections:\", [c.name for c in bpy.data.collections if c.name.startswith(\"V5_\")])\r\n82: \r\n83: bpy.ops.wm.save_as_mainfile(filepath=BLEND)\r\n84: print(\"SAVED:\", BLEND)\r"}
{"step_index":42,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:33:19Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:33:19+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:33:19+08:00\nShowing lines 1-110 of 110\n1: # blender-supercar\r\n2: \r\n3: 真实银石赛道整圈的 AI 程序化赛车场景（Blender 5.3 / EEVEE / 纯 CPU）。\r\n4: \r\n5: ## 目录\r\n6: \r\n7: | 目录 | 内容 | 说明 |\r\n8: |---|---|---|\r\n9: | **[LATEST/](LATEST/)** | `v5_stage_anim.blend`、`v5_stage_env.blend`、`v5_stage_anim_clay.blend` | **最新工程，只放这三个**（彩色动画 / 环境 / 白模） |\r\n10: | [pipeline/](pipeline/) | `v5_env.py`、`v5_anim.py`、`render_v5.py`、`mux_v5.sh`、`v5_clay.py`、`render_clay.py`、`mux_clay.sh`、`v5_viewport_fast.py`、`v5_preview.py`、`v5_stills.py`、`v4_stage_rig.blend` | 现役管线；`v4_stage_rig.blend` 是 V5 的模型+骨架输入 |\r\n11: | [renders_v5/](renders_v5/) | 彩色成片 `f1_silverstone_lap_1080p.mp4`、白模成片 `f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4`、`stills/`、`clay_stills/`、`frames/`、`clay_frames/`、`audio_v5_90s.m4a` | 最新渲染产物 |\r\n12: | [images/](images/) | `reference/` 参考图、`renders_old/` 旧静帧 | 所有散图集中在这里 |\r\n13: | [textures/](textures/) | 人群 / 沥青 / 贴花 / 广告板 / 刹车牌 / 大屏贴图 | 由脚本生成或 Pillow 生成 |\r\n14: | [track_data/](track_data/) | Silverstone / Monza 的 json+csv+生成器 | **改赛道就改这里** |\r\n15: | [audio/](audio/) | `audio.wav`（原曲）、`beats.json`、`cue.json` | 卡点数据 |\r\n16: | **[scenes/](scenes/)** | 场景库：历届赛历、天气预设、8 个精选场景卡、AI 提示词包 | **拍什么先看这里** |\r\n17: | [docs/](docs/) | `README_V5.md`（主文档）、`README_V4.md`、赛道数据说明 | |\r\n18: | [archive/](archive/) | `blend/` 旧工程、`scripts/` 旧脚本、`renders/` 旧成片 | 只读归档，别在这上面改 |\r\n19: | [_unrelated/](_unrelated/) | 不属于本项目的杂项 | 可删 |\r\n20: \r\n21: ## 两种成片\r\n22: \r\n23: | 版本 | 文件 | 用途 |\r\n24: |---|---|---|\r\n25: | 彩色（带材质/贴图/黄昏光照） | [renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_1080p.mp4](renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_1080p.mp4) | 最终成片 |\r\n26: | 白模（clay，统一灰模） | [renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4](renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4) | 看形体、光影、构图、运动；对客户/评审展示结构用 |\r\n27: \r\n28: 白模是同一套动画、同一套 26 机位，只把材质换成灰模（车 0.88 / 环境 0.40，`Standard` 视图变换）。分别有带音乐和无音乐两版。\r\n29: \r\n30: 重新生成：\r\n31: \r\n32: ```bash\r\n33: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\r\n34: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_clay.py        # 生成白模工程 LATEST/v5_stage_anim_clay.blend\r\n35: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/render_clay.py    # 渲染 2161 帧（约 12 min）\r\n36: bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh             # 合成\r\n37: ```\r\n38: \r\n39: ## 打开哪个\r\n40: \r\n41: 打开 **[LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend](LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend)**。里面有模型、骨架、环境、2161 帧动画、26 个机位。\r\n42: \r\n43: `v5_stage_env.blend` 只有环境和模型、没有动画，改环境时用这个（改完重新跑 `v5_anim.py`）。\r\n44: \r\n45: ## 改东西的三条路\r\n46: \r\n47: **1. 改单个物件**（挪看台、换广告板颜色、删一根灯柱）\r\n48: 直接开 `LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend`，Outliner 里按集合找：\r\n49: \r\n50: | 集合 | 内容 |\r\n51: |---|---|\r\n52: | `V5_01_Road` | 路面、赛车线、边线、路肩、起跑线、pit lane |\r\n53: | `V5_02_Terrain` | 地面、草地缓冲带、砾石坑、天空穹顶 |\r\n54: | `V5_03_Barriers` | 护栏、防护网立柱 |\r\n55: | `V5_04_Stands` | 6 座看台的全部零件（阶梯/柱/梁/旗） |\r\n56: | `V5_05_Pit` | 维修墙、车库楼、楼顶看台 |\r\n57: | `V5_06_Props` | 广告板、刹车牌、大屏、天桥、裁判点、机库 |\r\n58: | `V5_07_Lighting` | 太阳、补光 |\r\n59: \r\n60: 所有环境对象的原点已经挪到各自几何中心，`G`/`R`/`S` 都是跟手操作。\r\n61: \r\n62: **2. 改赛道形状**（挪弯道、改半径、换赛道）\r\n63: 改 [track_data/](track_data/) 里的 json，或换赛道重新生成，然后重跑管线：\r\n64: \r\n65: ```bash\r\n66: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\r\n67: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_env.py      # 环境 ~3 min\r\n68: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_anim.py     # 动画 ~1 min\r\n69: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/render_v5.py   # 渲染 ~30 min（2161 帧）\r\n70: bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh            # 合成\r\n71: ```\r\n72: \r\n73: **3. 改单帧出图**（只调镜头/材质，不重渲全片）\r\n74: \r\n75: ```bash\r\n76: \"$B\" -b -P pipeline/v5_anim.py -- --test 40,700,1500\r\n77: ```\r\n78: \r\n79: ## 视口卡顿\r\n80: \r\n81: 场景 919 个对象、915 个网格。视口采样已从 16 降到 8，但重物件还是要靠显示模式压：\r\n82: \r\n83: ```bash\r\n84: B=\"/d/APPs/steam/steamapps/common/Blender/blender.exe\"\r\n85: \r\n86: # 切到快速模式：看台/道具/地形集合视口隐藏，重物件只显示包围盒\r\n87: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- fast\r\n88: # 改完保存，之后打开就是快速模式\r\n89: # 恢复实体显示\r\n90: \"$B\" -b LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend -P pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py -- normal\r\n91: ```\r\n92: \r\n93: 改的是 `hide_viewport` / `display_type`，**渲染完全不受影响**。\r\n94: \r\n95: UI 里的快捷键：\r\n96: \r\n97: | 操作 | 键 |\r\n98: |---|---|\r\n99: | Solid 模式（最有效） | `Z` → Solid |\r\n100: | 局部视图，只看选中 | `Numpad /` |\r\n101: | 聚焦选中 | `Numpad .` |\r\n102: | 隐藏选中 | `H` / 恢复 `Alt+H` |\r\n103: | 框选放大区域 | `Shift+B` |\r\n104: | 关集合 | Outliner 点集合眼睛 |\r\n105: \r\n106: 详细清单见 skill `blender-procedural-scene`。\r\n107: \r\n108: ## 复现环境\r\n109: \r\n110: Blender 5.3.0，无 GPU（Cycles compute device = NONE），EEVEE 纯 CPU，1080p 单帧约 2.3 s。\r"}
